# Stage-2 statement gate: elaboration log

Tool: `bash <S>/tools/leanelab.sh <S>/wt-g2 <S>/oleans-f7 <file>` (direct `lean`, no `-o`,
no olean written). Worktree: the read-only campaign-tip checkout `wt-g2`; olean snapshot
`oleans-f7` (all of TCSlib, `TCSlib/Programs` included, and Mathlib). Toolchain:
`leanprover/lean4:v4.25.0`. <OUT> is the pack's output directory; <S> the scratchpad.
Run: 2026-10-13 04:35 UTC.
In the repository the files map as: <OUT>/{Stage2,NDSlice,LanguageExtensions}.lean ->
audits/evidence/stage2-gate/<Name>.lean.txt; <OUT>/probes/<P>.lean ->
audits/evidence/stage2-gate/probes/<P>.lean.txt; <OUT>/work/<script> (cutcheck.py, stmtdiff.py,
names.py, cited.py, widths.py, mkprobes.py, runall.sh and the two probe tails) ->
audits/evidence/stage2-gate/scripts/<script>; <OUT>/work/lint.py is
scripts/campaign_style_lint.py with its ROOT line pointed at a copy of the three files.

